{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Star Man</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A survival adventure where you build a raft and escape from a deserted island.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playtime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approx. 30 hours</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gathering, crafting, sailing, and questing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story equivalent to 60,000 words of a novel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English Mode Supported.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming and Let's Plays</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We wholeheartedly welcome them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t need to include the game title in your video title or add the store page URL in the description.<br>Feel free to stream or upload videos as you like.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Note</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game resolution is fixed at 1600x900.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please adjust your monitor\u2019s resolution accordingly when playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4025280?t=1759493089","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025280/555e561cf8cfdf844f0ef230110c6e1af09a341e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759493089","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025280/b094633f955890e856c7005e2bc3391d33f32a97/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759493089","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025280/b094633f955890e856c7005e2bc3391d33f32a97/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759493089","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Star Man</h2><p class=\"